\label{lem: finiteness of description of terminal threefold singularities}
Let ${\Gamma}\subset [0,1]$ be a set such that $\gamma_0:=\inf \{b\mid b\in{\Gamma}\setminus\{0\}\}>0$. Let $(X\ni x,B)$ be a threefold germ, such that 
